   "width": 635.25,
   "height": 75.0,
   "text": "Error state: any uncaught exception (e.g. Groq still failing after 4 retries,\ndatabase down) returns HTTP 500 with the message.\nA new request on a paused thread starts fresh; the old pause is dropped\n(verified against LangGraph 1.2.2).",
