   "y": 2393.75,
   "width": 330.0,
   "height": 112.5,
   "text": "NOT measured (sandbox can't reach them):\n- LLM latency and tokens per call\n- external API latency\n- cost per request\nSo the real end-to-end time is unknown;\nthe LLM calls almost certainly dominate.",
