   "text": "Interview answer: 'The critical path is 5 sequential LLM calls plus 4 API calls. I'd measure first\n(tracing per node), then parallelise research, stream the answer, and cache. Our own overhead is\nabout 80 ms, so the gains are in the model and API calls.'",
