   "x": 183.37499999999994,
   "y": 3851.875,
   "width": 833.2500000000001,
   "height": 56.25,
   "text": "Interview answer: 'Unit tests with a fake LLM make the graph deterministic, so routing, fallbacks and\nguardrails are tested on every commit. LLM quality needs a separate eval set, scored by rules and an\nLLM judge, run before changing the model or prompts.'",
   "originalText": "Interview answer: 'Unit tests with a fake LLM make the graph deterministic, so routing, fallbacks and\nguardrails are tested on every commit. LLM quality needs a separate eval set, scored by rules and an\nLLM judge, run before changing the model or prompts.'",
