   "x": 2172.375,
   "y": 3364.375,
   "width": 305.25,
   "height": 131.25,
   "text": "Limits found in the code:\n- one psycopg connection shared by\n  all worker threads (psycopg_pool is\n  installed but unused)\n- no auth, no rate limit\n- no tracing\n- checkpoints never deleted",
   "originalText": "Limits found in the code:\n- one psycopg connection shared by\n  all worker threads (psycopg_pool is\n  installed but unused)\n- no auth, no rate limit\n- no tracing\n- checkpoints never deleted",
   "fontSize": 15,
